    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper struct for trackAssignments, below. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>We don&apos;t use the similar <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_debug_variable" kindref="compound">DebugVariable</ref> class because trackAssignments doesn&apos;t (yet?) understand partial variables (fragment info) as input and want to make that clear and explicit using types. In addition, eventually we will want to understand expressions that modify the base address too, which a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_debug_variable" kindref="compound">DebugVariable</ref> doesn&apos;t capture. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
